    "result_text": "All 260 tests pass, including the new acceptance test. \n\n## Summary\n\nThe change is implemented in the owner create endpoint (`POST /api/owners`), handled by `OwnerRestControllerV1.addOwner`.\n\nI added a dedicated SLF4J logger named `AUDIT`:\n\n```java\nprivate static final Logger AUDIT = LoggerFactory.getLogger(\"AUDIT\");\n```\n\nand emit an audit line immediately after the owner is successfully persisted (so `owner.getId()` is populated), carrying the three required fields:\n\n```java\nthis.clinicService.saveOwner(owner);\nAUDIT.info(\"owner created: id={} customerCode={} registrationDate={}\",\n    owner.getId(), owner.getCustomerCode(), owner.getRegistrationDate());\n```\n\nThis satisfies the spec: on successful create the `AUDIT` logger records a line containing the owner id, the `customerCode`, and the `registrationDate`. The `AcceptanceTest.coreLogsAuditOnCreate` test \u2014 which captures the `AUDIT` logger and asserts a single message contains all three values from the created/fetched owner \u2014 passes, and the full suite (260 tests) is green.",
